    "name": "Non-Cash Deposits",
    "description": "# Non-Cash Deposits API\n\nRead and post/review for clinic `non_cash_deposit` records. Create, update, delete, and upload are **not** in this API (same as cash deposits).\n\n## Auth\n- Header: `API-KEY` (required)\n- Query/body: `token`, `requester` (required on all endpoints)\n\n## Branch scoping\n`branch_id` selects the clinic database. Required on every request.\n\n| branch_id | Clinic |\n|-----------|--------|\n| 1 | Mobile |\n| 2 | Oakridge |\n| 3 | Mactan |\n| 4 | Consolacion |\n| 7 | Mantlewood |\n\n## Mode of payment\n`mop` is an integer ID. Responses return the ID only (no name join).\n\n## Bank service fee\n`bank_service_fee_id` and `bank_service_fee_percentage` are required when posting. Get joins `bank` through the fee (`bank_name`). You may send `bank_service_fee_id` on `change_status` if it is not already on the row; percentage is snapshotted from `bank_service_fee.percentage` when empty.\n\n## Status workflow\n- Column `status`: `unposted` (default) or `posted`\n- Flag `is_reviewed`: `0` or `1`\n- `POST /change_status` accepts `posted` or `reviewed` only\n- List/report `status` filter: `posted` / `unposted` match the column; `reviewed` → `is_reviewed = 1`; `for_review` → `is_reviewed = 0`\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
