        "description": "## GET `/non_cash_deposits/get`\n\nList non-cash deposits from the clinic DB for `branch_id`. Each row includes attachments and branch name.\n\n### Query params\n| Param | Required | Notes |\n|-------|----------|-------|\n| `token` | yes | Auth token |\n| `requester` | yes | User id |\n| `branch_id` | yes | Clinic DB selector |\n| `non_cash_deposit_id` | no | Filter by id |\n| `mop` | no | Mode of payment integer ID |\n| `status` | no | `posted` / `unposted` match column; `reviewed` → `is_reviewed = 1`; `for_review` → `is_reviewed = 0` |\n| `date_from` / `date_to` | no | `deposit_date` range (both required together) |\n| `page` | no | 1-based page |\n| `data_size` | no | Page size |\n\n### Success\n`{ \"size\": n, \"data\": [ ... ] }` — `size` is the unpaginated count."
      },
