        "description": "## GET `/non_cash_deposits/get_report`\n\nAggregated report grouped by `deposit_date`, `sales_date_from`, `sales_date_to`, and `mop`. Returns `total_amount` plus review/status fields.\n\nDoes **not** include cash-count sales variance (cash-deposit only).\n\n### Query params\nSame as `GET /non_cash_deposits/get`.\n\n### Success\n`{ \"size\": n, \"data\": [ ... ] }` — `size` is the unpaginated group count."
