        "description": "## POST `/non_cash_deposits/change_status`\n\nPost or review a non-cash deposit.\n\n### Form fields\n| Field | Required | Notes |\n|-------|----------|-------|\n| `token` | yes | Auth token |\n| `requester` | yes | User id + audit `posted_by` / `reviewed_by` |\n| `branch_id` | yes | Clinic DB selector |\n| `non_cash_deposit_id` | yes | `non_cash_deposit.id` |\n| `status` | yes | `posted` or `reviewed` |\n| `remarks` | no | `posted_remarks` when posting; `reviewed_remarks` when reviewing |\n\n### Effects\n- `posted`: sets `status`, `posted_by`, `posted_on`, `posted_remarks`\n- `reviewed`: sets `is_reviewed = 1`, `reviewed_by`, `reviewed_on`, `reviewed_remarks`\n\n### Errors\n- `400` — missing/invalid `branch_id`, invalid status, already reviewed, or update failed\n- `404` — record not found\n- `401` — invalid/missing API-KEY, token, or requester"
      },
